<div class="blog-post-separator"></div>
</div> <div class="blog-post" id="blog-post-991778577917127927">
<div class="blog-header">
<h2 class="blog-title">
<a class="blog-title-link blog-link" href="../../blog/6206963.html">危險事件</a>
</h2>
<p class="blog-date">
<span class="date-text">
		10/18/2018
	</span>
</p>
<p class="blog-comments">
<a class="blog-link" href="../../blog/6206963.html#comments">
<fb:comments-count href="../../blog/6206963.html"></fb:comments-count> <span class="fb_comment_count_label">評論</span>
</a>
</p>
</div>
<div class="blog-separator"> </div>
<div class="blog-content">
<div class="paragraph">​<span>今天在教室上課的時候我同學看到窗戶外有一位別班的同學坐在欄杆上，腳朝著外面，似乎快掉下去，我們六年級的樓層是在三樓，非常的高，掉下去應該會死掉。老師聽到我們班同學的描述，非常緊張，一下課直接到他們班跟別班老師告狀。要是我我絕對不敢像別班同學這樣子做，我不是怕會被老師修理，而是怕自己會摔下去，所以我一定只會在教學區玩而已。</span></div>
</div>
<div class="blog-social">
<div class="blog-social-item blog-fb-like"><fb:like action="like" href="http://www.hekote.com/1/post/2018/10/6206963.html" layout="button_count" share="false" show_faces="false" width="90"></fb:like></div><div class="blog-social-item"><a class="twitter-share-button" data-count="horizontal" data-text="危險事件 - &amp;#40657;&amp;#27580;&amp;#37941;&amp;#23627;" href="http://twitter.com/share?url=http://www.hekote.com/1/post/2018/10/6206963.html"></a></div>
<div style="clear:both"></div>
</div>
<div class="blog-comments-bottom">
